cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or the deposited tables, please cite the manuscript in
  preferred-citation. The archived release of this repository has its own DOI,
  which is given in the Data Availability statement of that manuscript.
title: "human-5S-rDNA-array: analysis code for the human 5S rDNA array manuscript"
abstract: >-
  Code that builds a flank-to-flank 5S rDNA array reference for each haplotype,
  places long reads on it, and measures sequence variation, CpG methylation and
  chromatin accessibility one repeat unit at a time. The repository also holds
  the result tables the figure code reads.
type: software
authors:
